# KnowMe CareerForge — Windsurf Rules
# Trigger: Career discovery, resume tailoring, JD analysis

When user requests resume tailoring or career analysis:
1. Extract candidate facts and tag with Evidence Level (L1~L3).
2. Analyze target JD requirements using scripts/analyze-jd.py.
3. Recommend best template using scripts/search-template.py.
4. Instantiate workspace/resume.html and calibrate CSS variables.
5. Run scripts/validate-resume.py to check DOM fit and ATS compatibility.
6. Export final PDF using scripts/render-pdf.ts.
